{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_04_1035_015siz", "source_sha256": "5431afbc75e0d7e2f8b7fbf33720120398acec95dc10a2fe5d16997ea2bf355a", "ja": "あっ……す、すみません！\n私……。", "zh": "啊……对、对不起！\n我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_04_1036_p", "source_sha256": "8615d8cca75749e5e1c43da8b82db64bca30abe87e6a7a164bbac92f094967c9", "ja": "すみません。残りの取材については、\n後日に調整という形でもよろしいでしょうか？", "zh": "对不起。剩下的采访，改天再安排，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_04_1037_zasshikisya", "source_sha256": "e16d5c374225bc53108d484c82d1e3e803e9f5296ed56ef368c9af5f4ae70bc9", "ja": "え、ええ、もちろん。私も、軽率な発言でした……\n水瀬さん、みなさんも、申し訳ありません。", "zh": "诶、嗯，当然。我刚才说话也太轻率了……\n水濑小姐，还有大家，对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_04_1038_007ior", "source_sha256": "04c7bde49d11d77bdb074dd77855b0560366e0b2ada4cf2faa45e036933741bd", "ja": "いいえ。\n……。", "zh": "不，没什么。\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
